BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-20_sun_half-marathon@trainingplan.local
DTSTAMP:20260726T121017Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:[Race] Half Marathon · 21km
DESCRIPTION:Session: 2026-09-20_sun_half-marathon\nType: race  ·  Status: 
 planned\n\nTargets:\n  - duration_min: 100\n  - distance_km: 21.1\n  - avg
 _hr_range: [144\, 154]\n  - avg_pace_min_per_km: 4:44\n  - pace_range_min_
 per_km: ['4:40'\, '4:46']\n\nNotes:\n*** RACE *** Half marathon — 21.1 k
 m. Sub-1:40 target (4:44/km). Last year: 1:49 — this is the A-goal\; B-g
 oal is sub-1:45 (4:58/km)\, still a 4-min PR.\n\nPacing\n  Km 1-3: 4:44\, 
 never faster. Banked seconds cost minutes later.\n  Km 4-15: lock in 4:42-
 4:46\, HR 144-154. Rhythm over heroics.\n  Km 16-21: race. Empty it in the
  last 3 km\, not at 16.\n\nDecision gate (set after the Sep 1 checkpoint s
 ession)\n  Green: 4x2km @ 4:40-4:44 felt controlled → race at 4:44.\n  A
 mber: it was a fight → race at 4:58 and negative-split.\n\nFueling\n  Br
 eakfast 2.5-3 h out\, familiar carbs.\n  1 gel ~15 min before start\, 1 ge
 l around km 10-12.\n  Water at stations — a few sips each\, don't skip.\
 n\nIf the day goes sideways\n  HR > 156 in the first 5 km → ease off 10 
 s/km immediately.\n  Side stitch → exhale hard on the opposite foot stri
 ke\, shorten stride until it clears.
DTSTART:20260920T060000
DTEND:20260920T074000
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
